.TH ZCTL 1 "2 September 2026" "ZoneCTL 4.12.0" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
zctl \- transactional DNS management toolkit for BIND 9
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zctl
.RI [ options ]
.I command
.RI [ arguments ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B zctl
provides guarded CLI and TUI workflows for DNS zones, records, lifecycle
operations and DNSSEC management. Mutating operations default to dry-run and
require explicit confirmation before changing BIND configuration.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B tui
Start the terminal user interface.
.TP
.B zone
Plan and execute zone lifecycle operations.
.TP
.B dnssec
Report, enable, verify and safely withdraw DNSSEC.
.TP
.B audit list
List recent privacy-safe audit results with optional zone, outcome, operation
and timezone-aware interval filters.
.TP
.B audit show
Show the allowlisted START and RESULT records for one transaction identifier.
.TP
.B audit export
Export filtered audit records as text or JSON on standard output.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/bind
BIND configuration inspected or modified by explicitly committed operations.
.TP
.I /var/lib/zonectl
ZoneCTL state, disabled zones and quarantine data.
.TP
.I /var/backups/zonectl-*
Transactional backups and manifests.
.TP
.I /var/log/zonectl/audit-v1.jsonl
Versioned privacy-safe audit registry read by the audit commands.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR named (8),
.BR rndc (8),
.BR named-checkconf (8),
.BR named-checkzone (8),
.BR dig (1)
